{"id": "official:sentence:0d19a3ee-dcb5-4705-b166-f61278df1605", "text": "我没法举起超过30千克的箱子。", "shortMeaning": "超过三十公斤的箱子我举不动。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4a43f859-0ba7-47b3-97fc-72d59cc50bc8", "text": "我没法告诉你我等这一刻等了多久。", "shortMeaning": "这一瞬我等了多久，说都说不清。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5886fb12-4ebb-401a-b5a4-001ff52ed9f4", "text": "我没法忍住我的眼泪。", "shortMeaning": "我的眼泪忍不住。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6ceb8e26-d10e-46be-b795-c672f49419ce", "text": "我没法忍受这种痛苦。", "shortMeaning": "这种罪我受不住。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8830a9b0-30ca-4631-a5e4-d2592337717c", "text": "我没法确认你的邮件地址是否正确，因为它太短了。", "shortMeaning": "你的邮箱地址太短，我没法断定对不对。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7fe2dc7e-02cf-481a-95a9-537b92186de2", "text": "我没法算得跟他一样快。", "shortMeaning": "我算得没他那么快。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b34f59ab-ff30-4336-9f68-d204514f6c97", "text": "我没看见什么弹孔。", "shortMeaning": "弹孔我一个也没见着。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4411c194-0a0b-4ad5-8052-3ac13ce4bb45", "text": "我没给她带花来，而是带来一本书。", "shortMeaning": "我没给她带花，带的是一本书。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ca09dc4c-31eb-421a-b3b5-1ad88fe5756a", "text": "我没能使用水龙头，因为它坏了。", "shortMeaning": "水龙头坏了，我用不成。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:aef26430-4e53-49f6-9b4a-66bfbd93a9d2", "text": "我没见过也没听过这样的事。", "shortMeaning": "这样的事我见没见、听没听。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:00e3abd7-22e4-4f0a-9183-a57996013192", "text": "我没请他来参加庆祝会，感到有点内疚。", "shortMeaning": "没请他来庆祝会，我心里有些过意不去。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:16c4ad6c-32ab-4bc3-8b11-0b75dbf742f7", "text": "我没跟他们发生冲突。", "shortMeaning": "我没跟他们起冲突。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:274b0570-3c46-4bcc-a0df-6c7614941264", "text": "我沿着河走了段路。", "shortMeaning": "我顺着河边走了一截。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3e359256-b324-4f7c-a104-4905f413191c", "text": "我法语说得不够好！", "shortMeaning": "我法语讲得还不够好！", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:23207809-b4ad-4bc7-9e17-a0c399b26b43", "text": "我注册了，现在该干什么呢？", "shortMeaning": "我注册好了，接下来做什么？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:db4915c8-0f29-4f29-b4c2-3043a1d19a54", "text": "我注意到他装得就好像他在读书一样。", "shortMeaning": "我瞧出他装着在看书。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7560006b-9ad0-4cda-b8d2-679bc6e9a354", "text": "我注意到她当时戴了顶新帽子。", "shortMeaning": "我留意到她那时戴着一顶新帽子。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e23e5473-e150-4387-ace9-08c7c9f56c1e", "text": "我注意到她戴着新眼镜。", "shortMeaning": "我看出她换了新眼镜。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8608354c-dea2-4c8b-af37-63058dc87a69", "text": "我注意到桌子比椅子更稳固。", "shortMeaning": "我看出桌子比椅子更结实。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f6b38ed9-fd66-4dde-b681-350b792244d2", "text": "我洗完澡之后喝了点汽水。", "shortMeaning": "洗完澡我喝了点汽水。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f796a7eb-d05c-4e70-b96d-cab7a592a456", "text": "我洗完碗后看了电视。", "shortMeaning": "碗洗好了我就看电视。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:35421504-1781-4e17-b217-7d5cedf5e02d", "text": "我消夜吃了速食面。", "shortMeaning": "夜宵我吃的是方便面。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:670339e5-cdd6-4caa-9bd3-b86bee74b455", "text": "我深信事情会往更好的方向转变。", "shortMeaning": "我笃信事情会往好处转。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:52feed58-47e1-4b83-8031-cfa8b020e4cd", "text": "我添加了一句世界语句子。", "shortMeaning": "我加了一句世界语例句。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1e51b2d0-eb1b-4d2f-b32f-f4ecdd8d0e28", "text": "我游泳可以游得很好。", "shortMeaning": "我泳能游得不错。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4e621971-c18d-4810-8bbb-eea8905338dd", "text": "我游泳可以游得很快。", "shortMeaning": "我游起来能挺快。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:26f9f0fa-b36a-4ed5-9d6a-fd3362ef51fd", "text": "我游泳很不在行啊。", "shortMeaning": "我游泳实在不行。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:04daaa76-87fa-49ec-89f8-4557e218a3d7", "text": "我游览了英国许多地方。", "shortMeaning": "英国我逛了不少地方。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:23714e1c-cc5c-44f1-9e51-78338f731479", "text": "我点了青蛙加面条。", "shortMeaning": "我要了青蛙配面条。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:54c1d671-3912-45e1-8c7d-638c4ab6837d", "text": "我焦急地在等着去聚会。", "shortMeaning": "我急着等去聚会。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a6201ccf-386a-4a26-8218-65bc87c82e28", "text": "我熬夜熬多久都行。", "shortMeaning": "熬夜熬多晚我都撑得住。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f64a569f-7912-4e07-8840-84b179e46ff5", "text": "我爱他，但他有了心上人。", "shortMeaning": "我爱他，可他心里已有人。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8049ee1c-ea40-451a-9f12-0ad9f65af9a8", "text": "我爱你。可不可以你也很巧的爱上我？", "shortMeaning": "我爱你。你能不能也正好爱上我？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:69783a45-d5e9-4895-b035-2287051fdeb2", "text": "我爱你如同新鲜的肉爱食盐。", "shortMeaning": "我爱你，就像鲜肉离不了盐。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:25011d08-8402-4d3e-88dc-143e74ee8621", "text": "我爱你胜过你爱我。", "shortMeaning": "我爱你比你爱我多。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:eb21983e-f404-4869-8efc-bdd9f83f18b8", "text": "我爱你胜过其他任何一个人。", "shortMeaning": "我爱你胜过爱任何人。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:81223564-9abe-4355-8b52-af588ec71082", "text": "我爱你，但是你不知道这一切。", "shortMeaning": "我爱你，可你全不知情。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3d9304c1-97cb-4dea-8b7a-f26189e6c39f", "text": "我爱听有关动物的笑话。", "shortMeaning": "我爱听讲动物的笑话。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3363beec-46d7-4c20-8cbd-6492b4b40254", "text": "我爱她，但是她却爱别人。", "shortMeaning": "我爱她，她却爱着旁人。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ae665d89-06bc-4daa-b8ba-e880d478e253", "text": "我爱添好运的点心。", "shortMeaning": "我喜欢添好运的点心。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:164a080e-663e-4408-b7cd-e037647f5cb0", "text": "我爱的那个男孩不爱我。", "shortMeaning": "我爱的那男孩，心里没我。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:674d4ffa-1be5-46d2-a868-52fcc535e240", "text": "我父亲一直卧病在床。", "shortMeaning": "我爸一直病着躺在床上。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1c4e67db-729d-4038-8edd-87cf0a02b5b9", "text": "我父亲一直很冷静。", "shortMeaning": "我爸向来沉着。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1a532d3f-74a8-4dac-b99d-bb6411b2fae6", "text": "我父亲不允许我嫁给他。", "shortMeaning": "我爸不许我嫁给他。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:62f97a18-c1ab-4115-a622-13a895941bb9", "text": "我父亲会游泳但我母亲不会。", "shortMeaning": "我爸会游泳，我妈不会。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b3487f41-4b16-4170-8b77-f3ed4e0734ab", "text": "我父亲住在名古屋有30年了。", "shortMeaning": "我爸在名古屋住了三十年。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b7695a95-abd0-483a-93c0-670fe4cabfea", "text": "我父亲六十岁就要退休了。", "shortMeaning": "我爸六十岁就要退下来了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:56d76726-10e4-4e85-a519-9a5fbe792e51", "text": "我父亲去世五年了。", "shortMeaning": "我爸走了五年了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:12daa7e1-ae27-45d5-a857-e5147df0223d", "text": "我父亲反对我去演唱会。", "shortMeaning": "我爸不赞成我去听演唱会。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e1696777-8f42-4f8f-85e6-cc3f4d4d41ca", "text": "我父亲周日早上打高尔夫。", "shortMeaning": "我爸星期天早上打高尔夫球。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6d06a1af-b6d7-4d72-9da0-7d23426365fa", "text": "我父亲和我时不时地去钓鱼。", "shortMeaning": "我爸跟我偶尔去钓鱼。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f251bd53-3b4d-464a-81f2-6b8a4ec48102", "text": "我父亲在花园边上装了篱笆。", "shortMeaning": "我爸在园子边上围了篱笆。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:fbc12a6c-764d-4f0a-a1af-11421b84fcae", "text": "我父亲是一名外科专家。", "shortMeaning": "我爸是外科专家。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:89e2b01e-9490-4634-ae9d-ead1f19acd6a", "text": "我父亲有时候会带我去他的办公室。", "shortMeaning": "我爸有时带我上他的办公室。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d06ecc2b-150f-4ec0-a0b1-ab7a7126aff9", "text": "我父亲每周把他的一部分工资存起来。", "shortMeaning": "我爸每星期把一部分工资存下。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:89f54932-cdbd-4b14-b09f-8bc0610176cb", "text": "我父亲比我母亲小2岁。", "shortMeaning": "我爸比我妈小两岁。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:858d3e6e-92cf-4fba-898e-406dc7ec464c", "text": "我父亲没之前好了。", "shortMeaning": "我爸不如从前了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a47c945a-3c4a-478d-8133-4015cb29e7fb", "text": "我父亲爱世上的每一个人。", "shortMeaning": "我爸爱世上每一个人。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:61e02740-c7e1-4958-8543-464de8c1033a", "text": "我父亲用一把锯子切木头。", "shortMeaning": "我爸拿锯子锯木头。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4442e733-0dcf-4f1c-8684-70314adf22e4", "text": "我父亲的母语是法语，我母亲的是英语。", "shortMeaning": "我爸的母语是法语，我妈的是英语。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:32649ef3-6247-48c4-883b-6b75f76abca3", "text": "我父亲的状况时好时坏。", "shortMeaning": "我爸的病况一会儿好一会儿坏。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0099e28d-ab3e-4a42-930d-bd75aca415d4", "text": "我父亲的车和木村先生的一样。", "shortMeaning": "我爸的车跟木村先生的相同。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e130da8c-bbac-4978-9beb-018b22dea693", "text": "我父亲经营外贸多年。", "shortMeaning": "我爸做外贸好多年了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d6295722-0916-42f2-8851-2a5cbaffde91", "text": "我父亲给我买了一辆自行车。", "shortMeaning": "我爸给我买了辆单车。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6d886c29-130d-4dc0-bfbf-c1739ac7909a", "text": "我父亲至今从未去过国外。", "shortMeaning": "我爸到现在没出过国。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e4327103-b3be-4416-9b52-438a528eac9c", "text": "我父亲逐渐好转了。", "shortMeaning": "我爸慢慢好起来了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:711b0fe0-eccd-467d-8313-db746b9ad25e", "text": "我父母不让我和男生约会。", "shortMeaning": "爸妈不许我跟男孩子约会。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9b0d1625-399b-47a2-b53c-a39f85057521", "text": "我父母去机场送我叔叔了。", "shortMeaning": "爸妈去机场送叔叔了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1dd8ad3e-0cbd-46d2-ba21-339338630b24", "text": "我父母在的时候，请你言语注意分寸。", "shortMeaning": "我爸妈在场时，你说话请留些分寸。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2e8ac255-3513-4a5d-acb2-cfa7139ba348", "text": "我爸爸不喜欢足球。", "shortMeaning": "我爸不爱看足球。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5577ea5b-888b-413a-8742-858cddc50748", "text": "我爸爸不是每天都走路上班的。", "shortMeaning": "我爸并不是天天走着去上班。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:459b5ab8-d74a-4d4e-ab76-3489715fa5cd", "text": "我爸爸买了个相机作为我的生日礼物。", "shortMeaning": "我爸买了台相机给我当生日礼物。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8064960c-1e76-4c4b-b882-5d3acc75d6f1", "text": "我爸爸会在这周末回家。", "shortMeaning": "我爸这周末会回家。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2b678195-e9a8-4056-90dc-4bbab7d38ba7", "text": "我爸爸是哈佛大学毕业的。", "shortMeaning": "我爸是哈佛出来的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9e94db7a-d38e-4b43-9f3a-9bc72ccc4201", "text": "我独自待在教室里。", "shortMeaning": "教室里只剩我一个人。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:08766ad6-d050-4174-a0f6-ac0466618e92", "text": "我猜不出他想说什么。", "shortMeaning": "他到底想说什么，我猜不着。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1b4b42c7-48c6-4852-b496-33ef781fd35f", "text": "我猜您是加拿大人。", "shortMeaning": "我猜您是加拿大来的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:96f00fc8-570e-4e74-8a96-2a966a1a94f8", "text": "我猜想你可能是对的。", "shortMeaning": "我寻思你也许是对的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:49d02ed5-457c-46b6-bec7-18d6523f997b", "text": "我猜我能老实地坐在这更久，不发一句牢骚，而不像你。", "shortMeaning": "我想我能比你老实坐得久些，一句怨言也不出。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:dd1395ab-d8ec-44c8-95b3-cc64e529605a", "text": "我猜明天会是好天气。", "shortMeaning": "我看明天天气会好。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:127bd3c8-c33f-4be4-8c7d-b7ec6d5a34d3", "text": "我猜这是我们的运气坏。", "shortMeaning": "我猜是咱们运气差。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2580b5eb-a82c-497b-8ce8-44f956e43625", "text": "我现在一点都不幸福。", "shortMeaning": "我眼下一点也不快活。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ef876b82-aabf-440c-971d-ee607531350d", "text": "我现在不想吃任何东西。", "shortMeaning": "我眼下什么也不想吃。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:fec78263-3863-42a6-a6de-14610b74324e", "text": "我现在不能和你聊天。", "shortMeaning": "我这会儿没法跟你聊天。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4c199074-8584-49d7-8b9a-5364a29e0c76", "text": "我现在不能回答你。", "shortMeaning": "我现在答不了你。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:32c9b359-7f23-43bf-96fd-cbeefaba0549", "text": "我现在仅有的东西就是我的记忆了。", "shortMeaning": "我如今只剩记忆。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c6c627e6-c44c-4cac-ae6e-2820487b8732", "text": "我现在几乎不能够思考。", "shortMeaning": "我这会儿几乎想不了事。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:296b2f77-b17f-452f-9cfd-467a4cb36287", "text": "我现在只想睡点觉。", "shortMeaning": "我现在只想着睡一觉。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f5097385-43ed-456b-a5db-aaa7aff30d1d", "text": "我现在居住在北京。", "shortMeaning": "我如今住在北京。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
